            {
              "cardId": "c_1061_srt4",
              "name": "With All My Heart!",
              "note": {
                "en": "Epiphany V"
              },
              "rating": "4/5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Heart 1: 3 Heart Breaker is great, but it also leads to Clogging your Deck really quickly\nHeart 2: Can help clean out your draw/discard piles\nHeart 3: Can change Exhaust Fodder into Heart Bullets, its gimmicky\nHeart 4: The Best version, because it makes it so you don't clog up your deck with Bullets\nHeart 5: Can generate 3 5 7 Heart Breaker per turn, Very quickly can clog up your draw pile"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1061_uni2",
              "name": "Pistol of Purification",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              },
              "rating": "1/5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Pistol 1: Equivalent to 180% + 80% x 3\nPistol 2: Equivalent to 180% + 80% x 5, but the condition is much harder to achieve consistently\nPistol 3: Activating 10 Resonance at a time is a bit excessive, and also doesnt generate Resonance\nPistol 4: This requires roughly 3 bullet discards before beating Pistol 1, after that Moral is required\nPistol 5: Completely Unnessicary, because discarding already activates Resonance gradually"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
