        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "C'mere 1: Just worse then Heart besides the slight upside of making extra Resonance\nC'mere 2: This is great, discarded 2 to make 3 Shakers but also maybe activing Quietus\nC'mere 3: Its a pretty good way to convert Exhaust Fodder\nC'mere 4: Guranteed 3 Resonance 2 from Cmere, 1 from Breaker discarding Shaker\nC'mere 5: Retains to make 1 Shaker each turn, its pretty nice"
          }
        },
